=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d452677ee2639cc05b0e773ce7e7d795", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ad9e4e6a/uploads/origins/907f605a-e817-4e18-9fa0-f6662827e1bb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d452677ee2639cc05b0e773ce7e7d795, https://si.imgix.net/ad9e4e6a/uploads/origins/907f605a-e817-4e18-9fa0-f6662827e1bb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c3086276eed537628ced4f2f32e6b6f7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ad9e4e6a/uploads/origins/907f605a-e817-4e18-9fa0-f6662827e1bb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d886875be6e380b6b27dd7ee634f7d35 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！\nお元気ですか？\n海の幸を堪能するナズーリンを描いていただけませんか？\n全てお任せします！\nありがとうございました！\n\nHello!\nI hope you are doing well!\nWould you be able to draw Nazrin enjoying a meal of tasty seafood?\nI'll leave everything up to you!\nThank you very much!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Carbohy1290/works/63", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3c814197/uploads/origins/1a8fb8c1-ecb6-410d-a837-4b9e8edfb512?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c82eaa4933f53ff21806b9c0ff2762b0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3c814197/uploads/origins/1a8fb8c1-ecb6-410d-a837-4b9e8edfb512?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c82eaa4933f53ff21806b9c0ff2762b0, https://si.imgix.net/3c814197/uploads/origins/1a8fb8c1-ecb6-410d-a837-4b9e8edfb512?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=292e16368d5df8078b10f2146266468a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3c814197/uploads/origins/1a8fb8c1-ecb6-410d-a837-4b9e8edfb512?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d2e3821626606c318ed29d0ffa15e314 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "はじめまして、\n\n・キャラは東方錦上京の道神馴子\n・表情は笑顔\n・構図は正面からの膝上立ち姿 \n・ポーズは腕を頭の後ろに回した腋見せポーズ\n・元々